  "body": "This home is meticulously designed with family life at its core, creating a stunning first impression upon entering. The high-ceilinged foyer creates a ceremonial first impression, enhancing the overall sense of openness and showcasing the building's modernity and grandeur.\r\n\r\nThis freehold property sits on 621sqm (approx. ) of land, with a well-considered 362sqm (approx.) floor area. The overall layout is spacious and practical. The home features 6 spacious double bedrooms, including 2 ensuite bedrooms with a walk-in wardrobe, and 4.5 bathrooms that are both aesthetically pleasing and fully meet the daily needs of a large family.\r\n\r\nNext to the entrance is a separate, bright living room with an American Oak floor providing a quiet space away from the main activity area for family relaxation, entertaining guests, or evening relaxation. Large windows bring in ample natural light, keeping the space bright and warm.\r\n\r\nFurther inside is an open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area. The overall layout is well-planned, with interconnected yet clearly defined functional areas, allowing for interaction among family members while ensuring individual space. The space naturally extends to a meticulously landscaped garden, perfect for family relaxation or friends gathering. The garden includes an extra garden shed. The cover above deck creates a versatile outdoor area, perfect for relaxation or entertaining regardless of the weather.\"\r\nThe kitchen combines design and practicality, equipped with appliances including 2ovens and a wine fridge. The spacious island provides ample counter space and serves as a natural hub for family interaction, dining, and children's learning.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor layout is particularly outstanding, offering granny potential. It features two bedrooms sharing a full bathroom and a kitchen that can be flexibly separated by double doors. This kitchen can be used as a separate living area or integrated into the main house as needed, making it ideal for grandparents, teenagers living independently, working from home, or as future rental potential. The ground floor also includes a separate laundry area and a convenient guest toilet, adding convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a cozy second living room creates a tranquil and relaxing private space. There are a total of four bedrooms upstairs. Two ensuite bedrooms offer comfort and privacy for the family, featuring separate bathrooms and a walk-in wardrobe. The remaining two bedrooms share a modern bathroom. One bedroom offers stunning sea views directly from its window.\r\n\r\nOther features include:\r\n* Central air conditioning\r\n* Central vacuum system\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Underfloor heating in the bathrooms\r\n\r\nPerfectly situated within walking distance of Kinsway Schools and picturesque parks, and just minutes from motorway access, shopping areas, and charming cafes, this home combines lifestyle, comfort, and convenience in one ideal package.\r\n\r\nThis is a home truly tailored for modern family life-spacious, flexible, and bright, it can comfortably accommodate both current living arrangements and future lifestyles.\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home.",
